sequenceDiagram
    participant AAP as Ansible Automation Platform
    participant Vault as HashiCorp Vault
    participant AD as Active Directory (LDAP)
    participant Windows as Windows Server
    participant NSSM as NSSM Service (DemoHelloWorldService)

    %% === Initial State ===
    Windows->>NSSM: Run service using AD account (svc-demo)
    Vault->>AD: Manages svc-demo via LDAP static role

    %% === Play 1: Credential Rotation and Retrieval ===
    AAP->>Vault: Authenticate via AppRole
    Vault->>AD: Rotate svc-demo password if required
    Vault-->>AAP: Return new credentials (base64 encoded)

    %% === Play 2: Update and Restart Service ===
    AAP->>Windows: Stop NSSM service
    AAP->>Windows: Update service credentials (svc-demo + new password)
    Windows->>NSSM: Apply updated credentials
    AAP->>Windows: Start NSSM service

    %% === Play 3: Log Verification ===
    AAP->>Windows: Read log file for recent entries
    Windows-->>AAP: Return log entry with updated hash/token

    %% === Loop ===
    loop Scheduled or Triggered Rotation
        AAP->>Vault: Re-initiate rotation workflow
    end